<main>
  <h1>About the museum</h1>
  <p>The Innopolis Museum of Natural History opened its doors on 12 April 2014. It started with a gift of 800 fossils from a private collector.</p>
  <p>Read <a href="history">our history</a> or go to the <a href="/staff/">staff area</a>. Unfinished articles wait in the <a href="/archive/drafts/">drafts archive</a>.</p>
  <p>A student ticket costs 150 rubles. Entry is free for children under 7.</p>
  <blockquote>
    <p>“A museum is a conversation with the past.” (Prof. A. N. Volkov, founder)</p>
  </blockquote>
